WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.079 --> 00:00:08.343
Rex groaned.

2
00:00:08.344 --> 00:00:14.716
"I'm trapped in this cave!"

3
00:00:14.717 --> 00:00:18.450
"He'll eat me!" a voice said.

4
00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:21.945
"Don't worry, Mike," someone said.

5
00:00:21.946 --> 00:00:28.328
"Huh?" Rex looked around.

6
00:00:28.329 --> 00:00:32.855
A dinosaur stepped forward.

7
00:00:32.856 --> 00:00:35.341
Her tail had a club.

8
00:00:35.342 --> 00:00:38.567
A rodent hid behind her.

9
00:00:38.568 --> 00:00:45.135
The dinosaur growled at Rex.

10
00:00:45.136 --> 00:00:48.074
"Mike is my pal.

11
00:00:48.075 --> 00:00:54.786
Do not eat him!"

12
00:00:54.787 --> 00:01:00.238
"I won't eat anyone," Rex said.

13
00:01:00.239 --> 00:01:03.284
"I'm Rex."

14
00:01:03.285 --> 00:01:12.368
The dinosaur nodded. "I'm Annie."

15
00:01:12.369 --> 00:01:16.090
"We must get out of here," Rex said.

16
00:01:16.091 --> 00:01:20.893
"Help me push the rock."

17
00:01:20.894 --> 00:01:25.043
"Grr!"

18
00:01:25.044 --> 00:01:29.436
Rex and Annie pushed.

19
00:01:29.437 --> 00:01:33.530
Mike cheered. "You can do it!

20
00:01:33.531 --> 00:01:35.403
Woo-hoo!"

21
00:01:35.404 --> 00:01:38.375
But the rock didn't move.

22
00:01:38.376 --> 00:01:42.826
Rex sighed.

23
00:01:42.827 --> 00:01:45.908
"Stand back!" Annie said.

24
00:01:45.909 --> 00:01:50.410
Annie swung her tail.

25
00:01:50.411 --> 00:01:54.274
Bam! Boom!

26
00:01:54.275 --> 00:01:57.669
The rock didn't move.

27
00:01:57.670 --> 00:02:00.790
But the cave shook.

28
00:02:00.791 --> 00:02:04.649
Dust began to fall.

29
00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:07.223
Then rocks fell.

30
00:02:07.224 --> 00:02:14.083
"Annie, stop!" Rex cried.

